class FunctionDocGenerator:
  Generate Google-style docstrings per function.

  methods:
    generate(func_info: FunctionInfo,
             context: str = None) -> str
      Prompt includes:
        - Function signature + body
        - Inferred types from AST
        - Calling context (what calls this function)
        - Similar documented functions (CodeBERT lookup)
      Output format: Google-style docstring with:
        Args: (each parameter explained)
        Returns: (return value explained)
        Raises: (exceptions documented)
