                          func: FunctionInfo) -> RubricScore
      6-dimension rubric (0-5 each):
        completeness: all args/returns documented?
        accuracy: types match actual code?
        clarity: readable English?
        examples: has usage examples?
        edge_cases: corner cases mentioned?
        consistency: matches codebase style?
      Total: sum of 6 dimensions / 30

    compute_coverage(repo_path: str) -> CoverageReport
      % functions with docstrings
      % classes with docstrings
      % modules with module-level docs
      Per-file breakdown

